# -*- mode: shell-script; sh-shell: zsh -*-
#
# Native zsh, sourced at the end of the init phase of every interactive shell (after
# all modules). Put personal aliases, keybindings and hooks here. Keep it quiet:
# startup prints nothing.
#
# This file also runs inside the marksharc function on `marksharc reload`, where a bare
# typeset, integer or local would be function-local: declare globals with -g
# (typeset -g name=value) or inside a function of your own.
